WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:03.770
HOW IS THAT?

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:06.906
&gt;&gt; GARY COHN HOPEFULLY WILL BE

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:08.441
STAYED FOR A LONG TIME.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.708
THAT WAS IN CAMP DAVID 2 MONTHS

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:11.844
AGO.

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:13.413
GARY COHN IS LEAVING THE WHITE

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.914
HOUSE IN ABOUT 3 WEEKS TIME.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:16.115
PUT OUT A STATEMENT AND HERE'S

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:23.022
PART WHAT HAVE IS READ:

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:35.668
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE A STATEMENT FROM THE

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.669
PRESIDENT AS WELL THAT READS:

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:54.687
ALL OF THAT NEWSBREAKING ONE

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:57.924
HOUR AGAIN.

00:00:54.821 --> 00:01:03.029
MICHAEL NEEDHAM IN HERITAGE

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:04.697
ACTION FOR AMERICA.

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:04.380
ANDY

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:08.935
AND

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:10.937
ANDY WALTER AND ELI LAKE.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:12.238
WE HAD A DIFFERENT TOPIC

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.740
PREPARED BUT THIS IS THE TOPIC

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:14.073
OF THE HOUR.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.007
MICHAEL?

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:16.943
&gt;&gt; IT'S INTERESTING.

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:19.145
IT'S BEEN TALKED ABOUT AS

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:22.648
HAPPENING FOR MANY, MANY MONTHS.

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:23.282
IT WAS STILL SURPRISING WHEN IT

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:27.620
HAPPENED.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:35.428
GARY COHN HAS BEEN PART OF A

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:37.497
FANTASTIC TEAM AND TREMENDOUS

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:37.797
ACCOMPLISHMENTS LIKE THE TAX

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:42.668
CUTS.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:44.170
AND ROLLING BACK DOWD FRANK.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:46.038
GARY COHN HAS BEEN THERE AT THE

00:01:44.303 --> 00:01:47.140
PRESIDENT'S SIDE WITH A

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.007
REMARKABLE RECORD.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.243
IT'S IMPORTANT FOR THE PRESIDENT

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:51.244
NOT TO ROLL THAT BACK WITH

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:51.778
TARRIFS OR OTHER POLICIES IN

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.813
RECENT DAYS.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:54.280
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE THEY HAD A GOOD

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:57.383
RELATIONSHIP.

00:01:54.413 --> 00:01:59.318
HE DREW THE LINE ON TARRIFS.

00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:00.686
&gt;&gt; YES, HE DREW THE LINE ON A

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:03.656
NUMBER OF THINGS.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:04.590
HE WAS UPSET ABOUT THE PULLING

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.059
OUT OF PARIS ACCORD.

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:07.927
HE WAS NOT A BIG FAN OF THAT.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:09.595
THEN THERE WAS A DRAMATIC BREAK

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:12.265
WITH THE PRESIDENT ON THE

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:15.334
PRESIDENT'S REACTION TO THE

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:17.904
VIOLENCE IN CHARLOTTESVILLE WITH

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:20.940
COHN SAYING, I WAS THINKING

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:25.645
ABOUT RESIGNING AND PENNED A

00:02:21.073 --> 00:02:27.647
LETTER OF RESIGNATION BUT WILL

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:29.282
STICK WITH THIS ADMINISTRATION.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.983
BUT I DISAGREE WITH THE

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:32.985
PRESIDENT SAYING THERE WAS

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:34.720
VIOLENCE ON BOTH SIDES.

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:35.555
THE TARRIFS ISSUES DIVIDED THE

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.990
PRESIDENT'S ECONOMIC TEAM.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:40.193
HE WAS ARGUING AGAINST MORE

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:41.294
TARRIFS OR ANY TARRIFS AT ALL.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.461
THAT'S NOT PARTICULARLY

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:44.330
SURPRISING TO SEE THAT HE IS ON

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:46.432
THE OTHER SIDE OF IT.

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:47.433
I AGREE THAT IT'S SURPRISING IT

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:51.370
WAS TODAY.

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:53.272
BUT I THINK WE ALL KNEW WHOEVER

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:55.842
WON THE WAR ON TARRIFS WAS GOING

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:56.142
TO STAY IN AND WHO LOST WOULD

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.778
LEAVE.

00:02:56.275 --> 00:03:00.813
&gt;&gt; IT APPEARED THAT GARY COHN

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:05.184
CAME FROM THE LEFT SIDE OF THE

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:07.620
AISLE WHEN IT CAME TO POLITICS.

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:09.922
GARY COHN IS SIDING WITH

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:11.190
REPUBLICANS ON THE HILL WITH THE

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:12.792
TARRIFS ISSUE.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:14.660
THAT'S DRIVING A WEDGE BETWEEN

00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:16.929
REPUBLICANS IN CONGRESS AND THE

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:17.230
PRESIDENT WHO SAID I RAN ON

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.031
THIS.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:21.200
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT RAN ON A LOT OF

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:23.803
THINGS HE DIDN'T DO.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:25.438
IT DOESN'T MEAN IT'S A GOOD

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:27.406
THING TO EMBRACE AN ECONOMIC

00:03:25.571 --> 00:03:32.545
POLICY FROM 100 YEARS AGO.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:32.979
I THINK IT'S BAD FOR THE

00:03:32.678 --> 00:03:34.647
CONSTITUENCY.

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:36.649
A LOT OF PRICES WILL GO UP.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.949
GARY COHN COMES FROM GOLDMAN

00:03:36.782 --> 00:03:38.951
SACHS.

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:40.820
THAT'S SOMETHING THAT BOTH LEFT

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:41.120
AND RIGHT AND NEITHER LEFT OR

00:03:40.953 --> 00:03:42.722
RIGHT.

00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:44.056
IT REPRESENTS THE CENTER OF

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:45.758
AMERICAN POLITICS.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:48.527
THIS IS A SIGNIFICANT BLOW.

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:50.663
I THINK IT SHOWS A FRACTURE OF

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:51.797
AMERICAN POLITIC IN A DEEP WAY.

00:03:50.796 --> 00:03:54.333
THE FACT THAT SO MANY

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:58.004
REPUBLICANS IN CONGRESS AND A

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:58.905
LOT OF DEMOCRATS IN CONGRESS ARE

00:03:58.137 --> 00:03:59.238
UNCOMFORTABLE WITH THE TARRIFS

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:01.340
POLICY.

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:01.841
THE PRESIDENT HAS A LOT OF

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:04.744
AUTHORITY HERE.

00:04:01.974 --> 00:04:07.980
&gt;&gt; THE WEST WINGITSELF, OVER THE

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:12.285
LAST 13.5 MONTHS, ON-SCREEN WE

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:15.087
WILL PUT THE NUMBERS AND FACES

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:15.388
WHO WERE IN THE WEST WINGARE

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:17.890
GONE.

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:18.224
I COUNT 19 IN LESS THAN 14

00:04:18.024 --> 00:04:20.626
MONTHS.

00:04:18.357 --> 00:04:22.795
THIS TWEET FROM THE PRESIDENT ON

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.062
WHITE HOUSE CHAOS IS INTERESTING

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:23.229
TOO:

00:04:38.377 --> 00:04:41.213
&gt;&gt; MICHAEL?

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:43.215
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT FEELS CHAOTIC TODAY.

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:45.851
IF YOU LOOK OVER THE LAST 14

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:47.987
MONTHS, IT'S BEEN A WHITE HOUSE

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:49.922
THAT HAS STORMED AND COME

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:52.491
TOGETHER AND COME TOGETHER.

00:04:50.056 --> 00:04:53.726
IT WORKS BETTER WHEN THE TEAM IS

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:55.328
WORKING TOGETHER.

00:04:53.859 --> 00:04:57.697
WASHINGTON NEEDS STRONG

00:04:55.461 --> 00:05:01.567
EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:04.303
CONGRESS 535 PEOPLE WITH

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:05.972
DIFFERENT AMBITTIONS NEED AN

00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:06.706
EXECUTIVE BRANCH THAT SAYS LET'S

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:08.240
GO FORWARD.

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:10.142
WE HAVE SEEN THIS IN THE PAST.

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:11.444
I AM SURE THE WHITE HOUSE WILL

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:13.079
COME BACK TOGETHER AND OPERATE

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:14.747
IN A MORE NORMAL FASHION.

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:16.549
&gt;&gt; HE SAID IF PEOPLE LEAVE, I

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.650
HAVE PLENTY OF PEOPLE TO COME

00:05:16.682 --> 00:05:19.986
RIGHT THROUGH THE DOOR.

00:05:17.783 --> 00:05:21.020
HE SAID WE HAVE HAD PLENTY OF

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:21.854
TALENTED PEOPLE WHO WANT TO WORK

00:05:21.153 --> 00:05:25.825
HERE AT THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:28.461
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE WILL SEE WHO TAKES

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:29.862
THE PLACE OF THE NATIONAL

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:31.564
ECONOMIC ADVISOR.

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:31.931
LOOK, THE CHAOS IS PART OF THE

00:05:31.697 --> 00:05:33.432
STRATEGY.

00:05:32.064 --> 00:05:34.266
IT'S NOT A BUG IN THE SYSTEM.

00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:36.569
IT IS THE SYSTEM.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:38.004
THIS IS WHERE THE PRESIDENT

00:05:36.702 --> 00:05:40.206
FEELS THE MOST COMFORTABLE,

00:05:38.137 --> 00:05:44.110
BEING IN A SITUATION WHERE IT

00:05:40.339 --> 00:05:45.544
LOOKS AS IF THERE IS NO ORDER

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:46.312
AND HE SEEMS TO BE THE MOST

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.947
COMFORTABLE IN THAT.

00:05:46.445 --> 00:05:49.482
A LOT OF PEOPLE, THAT'S NOT HOW

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:52.284
THEY LIKE TO WORK.

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:52.785
IT IS ALSO A VERY DIFFICULT WAY

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:54.153
TO PUSH STRATEGY.

00:05:52.918 --> 00:05:56.422
ALL REPUBLICANS ON THE HILL WANT

00:05:54.286 --> 00:05:57.723
TO TALK ABOUT RIGHT NOW:

00:05:56.555 --> 00:05:58.124
TAX CUTS AND THE ECONOMY,

00:05:57.857 --> 00:06:00.626
PERIOD.

00:05:58.257 --> 00:06:02.428
THEY DON'T WANT TO TALK ABOUT

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:04.363
TARRIFS OR GO OFF ON TANGENTS

00:06:02.561 --> 00:06:06.265
THAT THE PRESIDENT AND THE WHITE

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:07.967
HOUSE SEEM TO BE UNABLE TO FOCUS

00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:10.302
JUST ON THAT ONE STRATEGY.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:11.804
&gt;&gt; CHAOS IN THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:12.671
IT'S NOT COMPARABLE TO ANY

00:06:11.937 --> 00:06:14.373
MODERN PRESIDENT.

00:06:12.805 --> 00:06:15.307
I THINK THE NUMBER OF

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:19.311
RESIGNATIONS, THE FACT IT'S HARD

